  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nauru Australian Regional Development Scholarships Non Contract Institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nauru Australian Regional Development Scholarships provides opportunities for Nauruans to study tertiary programs in the Pacific region. The purpose of these awards is to allow Nauruans to gain knowledge and skills that will help in the development of Nauru by contributing to identified human resource training needs. The priority areas for Nauruan students include secondary education, health, human resource management, commerce, law, engineering and fisheries studies.</narrative>
  </description>
